      "content": {
        "id": "6ab85cc646be804931c31335",
        "meta": {
          "version": "0.0.3"
        },
        "zone": "ncs",
        "boardRef": "6a2629f436bfe25a75cb4c82",
        "content": "<div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0e02901f8-abf909cb-837c-4a8a-9101-68f363bf4539&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0e02901f8-abf909cb-837c-4a8a-9101-68f363bf4539\" alt=\"announcements_EN.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">The starting line up for the advanced access servers are now available!</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">In AION 2, each server houses only one faction. Every Elyos server is paired with an Asmodian counterpart, giving both factions their own home while still meeting in shared PvP spaces like the Abyss.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">When you launch Aion 2, you’ll first choose your Region, then your Faction, and finally select from the available servers in that region.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>The server access schedule is as follows:</strong></div><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"_2CAsiFd9UHbUOqzd0e7ioe _1CtoyG6UPAlYp7PCGLXx8L\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 174px;\"><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><th data-colwidth=\"174\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Advanced Access</div></th><td class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">September 30th at 6AM PDT - October 4th at 10PM PDT / September 30th at 13:00 UTC - October 5th at 05:00 UTC</div></td></tr><tr><th data-colwidth=\"174\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Maintenance*</div></th><td class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">October 4th at 10PM PDT - October 5th 6AM PDT / October 5th at 05:00 UTC - October 5th at 13:00 UTC</div></td></tr><tr><th data-colwidth=\"174\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Global Launch</div></th><td class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">October 5th at 6AM PDT / October 5th at 13:00 UTC</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">*Maintenance times are subject to change so please stay tuned into social channels for any updates.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><h3 id=\"\"><strong>Europe</strong></h3><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"_2CAsiFd9UHbUOqzd0e7ioe _1CtoyG6UPAlYp7PCGLXx8L\" style=\"width: 17.6564%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 124px;\"><col style=\"width: 99px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th data-colwidth=\"124\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Elyos</div></th><th data-colwidth=\"99\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Asmodian</div></th></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"124\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Siel</div></td><td data-colwidth=\"99\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Israphel</div></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"124\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Nezekan</div></td><td data-colwidth=\"99\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-ty